WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.810
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.580
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room bright,

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.570
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.810
Well, well, well.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:16.750
Have you ever had times when you
didn't know what you wanted to do?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.720
That's exactly the way I am right now.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.920
I worked hard, trying to get into Kaleido Stage.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.230
Then I worked hard so that I'd be
acknowledged by everyone,

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.660
and I worked hard, trying to
catch up with Miss Layla.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:30.770
But, I wonder what I'm working hard for now?

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:32.530
No... Not good. Not good.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:36.340
I can't become a star with my feelings
all wishy-washy like this.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.360
I can't! I can't!

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:47.950
