<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:25.070
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:30.330
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:30.330
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:37.710
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:37.710
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:43.120
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:46.290
Perhaps a match with you
is my unavoidable destiny.

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:48.200
And so, it's showtime!

00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:50.230
What? Mr. Yuri and Mr. Leon know each other?

00:23:50.230 --> 00:23:52.330
Wait! What happened between them?

00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:53.930
How would I know something like that?

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:57.200
What I saw during the battle
was betrayal and despair.

00:23:57.200 --> 00:24:01.180
Something I believed in is shattering!
Shattering! Shattering!

